    "bbox": [
      55.28,
      515.55,
      298.32,
      581.02
    ],
    "text": "I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, the Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation, do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.28,
      596.55,
      298.32,
      689.02
    ],
    "text": "All that allotment of land depicted in the Advance Tracing No. KU/NRM/2022/95 dated 25.09.2022, prepared by the Surveyor General , situated at the Village of Paranagama (FVP 566), in No. 1036 Paranagama Grama Niladhari Division, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Narammala in the District of Kurunegala in the North Western Province and bounded as follows:",
